From: nvvk <nvvk@nvidia-vulkan.local>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add nvvk frame generation hooks

This patch adds frame generation support to DXVK via nvvk library.
Interpolated frames are injected after real presents to double effective FPS.

Features:
- Automatic frame history capture
- Motion vector extraction from game frames
- AI-interpolated frame generation
- VRR-aware frame injection timing

Enable with: DXVK_NVVK_FRAME_GEN=1
---
